"""Tracker Calibration (Калібрування трекерів) — T-pose calibration of SteamVR trackers (Standable-like).

Reads real tracker poses from the fbtcal driver, computes straight "pencil pose"
offsets at a T-pose, and can freeze the trackers on an ideal T-pose so VRChat
can calibrate from any pose.
"""
